# The original might use the same timeout value for both dial and total request
# 
# Let me implement this with:
# - DialTimeout = opts.Timeout seconds
# - Total Client.Timeout = slightly longer or same
#
# Actually, I should use the DialContext approach where:
# - The DialContext respects the parent context
# - The context has the full timeout
# - This way the dial timeout is part of the total timeout
#
